@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title SEQ-15 - QUẢN TRỊ SẢN PHẨM & BÁN HÀNG
actor "Quản trị viên" as A
boundary "Admin UI" as UI
control "Admin API" as API
control "Admin Service" as S
control "Prisma Client" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
A -> UI : Mở dashboard
UI -> API : Yêu cầu dữ liệu quản trị
API -> S : requireAdmin() + load data
S -> P : query products/orders/customers/coupons
P -> DB : SELECT admin data
S --> API : dashboard data
API --> UI : Hiển thị
A -> UI : Thêm/sửa sản phẩm hoặc bán hàng
UI -> API : POST/PATCH admin APIs
API -> S : validate admin action
S -> P : persist business data
P -> DB : UPSERT/UPDATE
S --> API : saved
API --> UI : refreshed state
@enduml
